      "comment": "[WORLD] Setting overview (always on)",
      "content": "[World: New Eridu. A dense, neon-lit city that survived the catastrophe of the Hollows - spreading dimensional rifts full of hostile Ethereals and corrupting Ether. The city runs on salvage and resources pulled out of Hollows. Licensed Hollow Investigators go in; Proxies guide them remotely through the shifting interior, often using small rabbit-like robots called Bangboo. Tone: stylish urban action, street-level humor, small businesses and gangs with big personalities. Some citizens are Thiren - people with animal traits.]",
